1378:                <tr id="item-sheet-3-2-20"><td><a class="item-no" href="#pin-sheet-3-2-20"><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0306" data-excel-sheet="新規会員登録" data-excel-ref="0306:新規会員登録!B476">2-20</span></a></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0306" data-excel-sheet="新規会員登録" data-excel-ref="0306:新規会員登録!E476">戻る</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0306" data-excel-sheet="新規会員登録" data-excel-ref="0306:新規会員登録!M476">ボタン</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0306" data-excel-sheet="新規会員登録" data-excel-ref="0306:新規会員登録!T476">-</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0306" data-excel-sheet="新規会員登録" data-excel-ref="0306:新規会員登録!V476">-</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0306" data-excel-sheet="新規会員登録" data-excel-ref="0306:新規会員登録!Z476">-</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0306" data-excel-sheet="新規会員登録" data-excel-ref="0306:新規会員登録!AG476">・押下すると、入力内容を維持した上で会員登録画面へ遷移する</span></td></tr>
